---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---
<MarketingLayout title="Privacy Policy | Surge" description="Privacy policy for the Surge application and browser extension." canonical="/privacy/">
  <article class="utility-page space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated <time datetime="2026-06-15">June 15, 2026</time></p>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        The <strong class="text-white">Surge</strong> browser extension and desktop application are designed with your privacy as a foundational principle. We <strong>do not collect, transmit, distribute, or sell</strong> any of your personal data.
      </p>

      <p>
        All processing, downloading, and file management occurs <strong>locally</strong> on your machine. We do not integrate any analytics, telemetry, or tracking software into our products.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your download history, preferences, connection configurations, and personal information never leave your device. They remain entirely under your control.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you have any questions or concerns regarding our privacy practices, please feel free to open an issue on our <a href="https://github.com/surgedm/surge/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</MarketingLayout>
